Argus, a divinely noble face with a sharp chiseled jawline exposed beneath a pristine silver-gold helmet, the high-set helmet a ceremonial crown-visor with two prominent upward-curving horns that glow with soft radiant golden light at the tips, a vertical grate-style visor covering the upper face with three glowing sky-blue slits in place of eyes, no visible hair as the helmet merges seamlessly into a high-collared golden neck guard transitioning into a celestial chestplate, a towering athletic physique with a powerful V-tapered upper body characterized by broad armored shoulders and a disciplined narrow waist, gleaming layered silver armor across the torso intricately etched with golden filigree of sacred wings and sunbursts, a massive multi-layered pauldron on the right shoulder with sweeping blade-like protrusions of polished silver edged in gold, the left arm perfectly symmetrical and unblemished with a matching pauldron and vambrace set with a large radiant blue gem at the forearm, a long split-waist surcoat flowing to mid-calf with a pristine white exterior and a brilliant celestial blue interior held by a heavy golden belt with a central diamond-shaped sapphire buckle, articulated sleek golden greaves encasing the shins and knees with embossed feather motifs, armored sabatons covering the feet with sculpted golden toe-caps and subtle wing-shaped heel spurs, a magnificent pair of vast feathered wings on the back transitioning from pure white at the base to luminous golden tips fully substantial and glowing with a soft holy aura, wields a colossal single-edged curved greatsword forged from divine crystal, the blade a radiant ivory-white with a jagged but elegant edge, several wing-shaped protrusions along the spine near the hilt made of solid gold, the entire weapon wreathed in a gentle cerulean and golden flame, the hilt long enough for a two-handed grip wrapped in white leather and ending in a pointed sapphire pommel.

The Great Dragon (Sentinel of the Cadia Riverlands)
The Great Dragon, cascading waterfall of shimmering silk-like silver hair reaching lower back with two prominent high-set top knots secured by jade pins while the rest flows freely like mist in the wind, large almond-shaped molten gold eyes with pupils occasionally narrowing into draconic slits when channeling power, long refined jawline with straight noble nose anchoring countenance of eternal patience, warm sun-kissed olive skin with subtle luminescence radiating from beneath, small elegant white antlers sprouting from temples blending into silver hair and glowing with faint divine light, willowy yet resilient physique at 188 cm with lean corded strength of an immortal monk appearing in late fifties as Sovereign Sage, high-collared cross-front white damask tunic with intricate swirling river current embroidery, structured jade-colored vestment secured by golden toggles with shoulders capped by ornate silver pauldrons shaped like curving dragon horns venting faint cool mist, wide flowing sleeves tapering into tight silk-wrapped bracers at wrists, fingerless deep forest green leather wraps for precise spiritual energy manipulation, heavy golden ceremonial sash with long ends embroidered with Four Symbols trailing elegantly toward ground, layered charcoal-grey hakama-style trousers of durable heavy-weight linen with deep pleats creating wave-like motion, protective tasset of interlocking jade plates mimicking dragon scales each etched with protective wards glowing soft teal, high white-silk gaiters leading down to traditional open-toed sandals with heavy wooden soles and reinforced leather straps, moving with weightless gliding motion appearing to walk on air leaving faint glowing ripples of water-like energy. His weapon is the Staff of the Hidden Dragon, a 210 cm two-handed artifact carved from Spirit-Bamboo hardened to steel strength spiraled with golden wiring pulsing with rhythmic green light, the head featuring a large floating jade orb suspended within a cage of golden dragon claws rotating slowly and emitting soft melodic chime, carrying an aura of Harmonious Authority as swirling translucent teal-and-white mist smelling of mountain rain and aged tea that takes the shape of a massive Golden serpentine dragon coiled behind him.

King Aurelius II (The Iron Sun of Moniyan)
Aurelius II, thick voluminous mane of shimmering platinum-blonde hair reaching middle of back in perfectly groomed wavy layers styled in sophisticated swept-back royal cut with hair at temples pulled tight and secured into crown base, piercing cold cerulean blue eyes lacking any warmth possessing Holy-Gaze that judges everything it touches, elongated jawline with high sharp nose giving perpetual look of looking down upon the world, luminous pale porcelain skin seemingly untouched by sun, magnificent high-set diadem Halo of the Eternal Light of Sun-Forged Gold with several sharp needle-like rays fanning out behind head making it appear as permanent sun behind him, tall rigid height of 192 cm with broad-shouldered barrel-chested build of monarch trained from birth in statecraft and heavy plate combat appearing in mid-fifties, high-collared heavy pure white silk tunic embroidered with golden sun-motifs that seem to move as he breathes, massive symmetrical Sacred-Steel chestplate polished to mirror-like degree, colossal tiered pauldrons shaped like Seraphim wings with individual gold plate feathers, heavy floor-length deep royal blue velvet cape lined with white ermine fur fastened by two large glowing sun-crystals at collarbones, articulated golden gauntlets with intricate Moniyan history carvings and sapphire-reinforced knuckles, heavy layered white-enameled steel greaves protecting legs from hip to toe, long split-front heavy cream-colored damask battle-skirt cinched by massive golden belt featuring imperial sun-crest buckle with ceremonial gold and blue sashes representing high houses, digitigrade-style armored boots with heavy square-toed soles leaving deep authoritative imprints. His weapon is the Scepter of Absolute Radiance, a 200 cm massive two-handed staff of pure white marble reinforced with gold core featuring a massive floating diamond-shaped crystal emitting constant blinding white light, carrying an aura of Sterile Purity as cold sharp bleaching light smelling of ozone and incense that causes shadows to shrink and vanish leaving no room for nuance.

The High Priest of the Monastery (Architect of Discipline)
The High Priest, magnificent shoulder-length thick snowy white hair styled in dignified swept-back manner with two small braided locks near temples secured by gold rings, mesmerizing luminous sapphire blue eyes with piercing clarity looking directly into one's soul framed by thick silver-grey eyebrows, wide granite-like jawline with high hollowed cheekbones suggesting life of severe discipline, weathered noble tan skin etched with fine wisdom lines around eyes and deep forehead furrow, imposing statuesque presence at 188 cm with hardened tempered leanness of martial asceticism appearing in late fifties or early sixties, grand multi-layered white silk cowl and mantle with high-standing rigid collar reinforced with gold-plated filigree, heavy royal-blue silver-threaded pelerine over shoulders with long white stoles hanging down chest embroidered with sacred Claw of Light emblems in gold, fitted heavy white damask tunic cinched by wide golden sash, symmetrical tiered gold pauldrons shaped like stylized wings anchoring heavy floor-length white cape, pristine white liturgical gloves with hidden articulated silver bracers humming with faint holy energy on forearms, long split-front deep navy priest's cassock allowing wide sweeping martial artist stances, structured white trousers tucked into knee-high polished silver greaves etched with Monastery founding scenes and golden sun-shaped knee-guards, heavy square-toed white-gold alloy sabatons with grip-designed soles, heavy leather utility belt concealed beneath sash carrying sacred scrolls and small glowing blue holy water vials. His weapon is the Scepter of the Silent Claw, a six-foot blackened iron staff topped with a massive three-pronged golden claw matching Natalia's gauntlet design, the blades made of solidified light flickering with intense blue-and-white brilliance, carrying an aura of Suffocating Sanctity as heavy vibrating golden light field with low-frequency choral resonance and massive ghostly light wings expanding behind him.